  <h1 class="title">LinkedIn Premium: Closing the Job Seeker Value Gap</h1>
  <p class="deck">Premium Career sits adjacent to the hiring funnel rather than inside it. This case study unpacks why subscribers churn, then proposes a redesign that pulls Premium into the actual decision points where hires happen — with functional requirements and three working prototypes.</p>

  <div class="meta">
