  <div class="callout">
    <strong>The meta-point:</strong> Premium's problem isn't feature quality — it's that the product was built around <em>what LinkedIn can surface on LinkedIn</em>, not around <em>what job seekers actually need to get hired</em>. Every recommendation above is a variation on the same principle: follow the candidate into the hiring funnel instead of hoping they come back to LinkedIn.com to check their profile views.
